OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage trains begin trial of
OL,4,Acommuter service
OL,5,
OL,6,FA heritage railway is hoping to
OL,7,Fencourage commuters to get on board and
OL,8,Fuse its services to get to work.
OL,10,FThe Bewdley Express will leave its
OL,11,Fnamesake town in Worcestershire at
OL,12,F06:40 and 07:40 BST on Tuesdays,
OL,13,FWednesdays and Thursdays to take
OL,14,Fpassengers into Kidderminster where
OL,15,Fthey will change to a Birmingham
OL,16,Fservice.
OL,18,FEvening services will leave Birmingham
OL,19,FSnow Hill at 16:46 and 17:46.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
