OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage trains begin trial of
OL,4,Acommuter service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe eight-week trial, a partnership
OL,7,Fbetween the Severn Valley Railway and
OL,8,FWest Midlands Railway, is intended to
OL,9,Ftest demand for a regular rail
OL,10,Fconnection between Bewdley and the
OL,11,Fwider West Midlands network.
